# {{project_name}}

Self-hosted website-to-RAG chatbot, scaffolded by `web2rag` v{{plugin_version}}.

See `CLAUDE.md` for the architecture brief, cost contract, and inviolable rules.

## Quickstart

```bash
# 1. Fill in the env (interactive: prompts for ANTHROPIC_API_KEY + CHAT_MODEL)
/web2rag-setup

# 2. Start the stack
/web2rag-serve

# 3. Ingest a website (zero outbound cost)
/web2rag-ingest https://docs.acme.com --max-pages 200

# 4. Get the embed snippet
/web2rag-embed-snippet docs.acme.com
# paste the printed <script> tag into the customer's HTML

# 5. (later) audit the bot
/web2rag-audit all --judge anthropic-haiku --output html
```

## Skills available in this project

All non-init skills assume cwd. Pass `--project <path>` to invoke from elsewhere.

- `/web2rag-setup` — fill `.env`, verify docker
- `/web2rag-serve` / `/web2rag-stop` — docker compose lifecycle
- `/web2rag-ingest <url>` — crawl + chunk + embed (politeness flags: `--force`, `--rate`, `--concurrency`, `--user-agent`)
- `/web2rag-update <site>` — delta re-crawl
- `/web2rag-list-sites` / `/web2rag-remove-site <site>`
- `/web2rag-embed-snippet <site>` — print the customer-facing `<script>` tag
- `/web2rag-audit quality|capability|redteam|all --judge anthropic-haiku|ollama:<model>` (DeepEval + DeepTeam, four-axis)
- `/web2rag-chat-test "<question>"` — cost-free preview via in-session Claude Code subagent (same retrieved chunks + system prompt, $0)
- `/web2rag-chat "<question>"` — paid real /chat SSE stream from TUI (~$0.01/msg on Haiku, full Python guards)

